WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.250 --> 00:00:04.019
The question comes first: revenue quality.

2
00:00:04.019 --> 00:00:09.954
Check the grain of the data and its definitions before you draw a chart or build a model.

3
00:00:10.354 --> 00:00:13.007
Reconcile the source totals in Excel.

4
00:00:13.007 --> 00:00:17.667
In a notebook, inspect missing values and revenue distributions.

5
00:00:17.667 --> 00:00:23.474
Use Python and SQL to separate a true business change from a data-quality issue.

6
00:00:23.874 --> 00:00:31.651
Model the measures in Power BI, compare segments in Tableau, and inspect the operational signal in Grafana.

7
00:00:31.651 --> 00:00:36.811
Trace each metric back to its definition before presenting the result.

8
00:00:37.211 --> 00:00:39.977
Publish the story as executive dashboard.

9
00:00:39.977 --> 00:00:45.508
Let people filter the view, inspect the evidence, and understand the next action.

10
00:00:45.508 --> 00:00:50.298
The presentation should remain clear when the underlying data changes.
